"Use variant\\_dbid for exact LOVD variant IDs (e.g., 'TP53\\_010464') or "
"dna\\_notation for HGVS notation without RefSeq prefix (e.g., "
"'c.\\*2609C>A'). At least one search parameter is required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/lovd_tools.rst:101 0062643802c2491fbf46e889bc7a3402
msgid ""
"``variant_dbid`` (string) (optional) LOVD variant DBID (e.g., "
"'TP53\\_010464'). Unique identifier assigned by LOVD."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/lovd_tools.rst:104 fabc6a7902884d32ae3aecb9575932e6
msgid ""
"``dna_notation`` (string) (optional) HGVS DNA notation without RefSeq "
"prefix (e.g., 'c.\\*2609C>A', 'c.742C>T'). Use coding 'c.' notation."
msgstr ""

